## State

Run 2 (build, sonnet): following the plan below as written.
- [ ] write apps/web/src/cards/costGem.test.ts (plan step 1)
- [ ] run it before the fix: test 1 must fail (step 2)
- [ ] add `box-shadow: none;` to `.cf .cost-gem` in cards.css (step 3)
- [ ] run new + neighbouring tests, typecheck, full web test, eslint (steps 4-5)
Screenshots are not attachable by the bot: say so in the report.

## Log
(earlier lines of the log were cut here)
